{"aliases":["YOLO","YOLO 目标检测","You Only Look Once"],"external_ids":{},"history":[{"agent":"claude-code","at":"2026-11-08T09:58:18.416339+00:00","fields":["id","how","why","kind","name","slug","what","layer","props","status","name_zh","summary","created_at","importance","tracked_at","expanded_at","merged_into","occurred_at","created_by_run"],"intent":"seed: CNN, LSTM, NMT, YOLO, SegNet, Image Captioning","op":"insert","reason":"resolve 无候选；按家族建点，YOLOv5 等版本进别名","run_id":"r_20261108_c26vf8"}],"node":{"created_at":"2026-11-08T09:58:18.416339+00:00","created_by_run":"r_20261108_c26vf8","expanded_at":null,"how":null,"id":"n_01m6x9gc2s7kttk9b4","importance":4,"kind":"model","layer":"knowledge","merged_into":null,"name":"YOLO","name_zh":"YOLO 目标检测","occurred_at":null,"props":{"first_version":"YOLOv1 (2015)"},"reviewed_at":"2026-11-08T09:58:18.453978+00:00","slug":"yolo","status":"active","summary":"把目标检测当作回归问题、单次前向直接输出框和类别的实时检测器家族。","tracked_at":null,"updated_at":"2026-11-08T09:58:18.416339+00:00","updated_by_run":"r_20261108_c26vf8","what":"把图像划分为网格，每个网格单元直接预测边界框、置信度和类别概率，整个检测流程是一个卷积网络。","why":"R-CNN 类方法分多阶段（候选框、分类、后处理），各部分需单独训练，慢且难优化。YOLO 把检测统一为端到端回归，一次评估即可，因此能实时运行。"},"relations":[{"confidence":0.95,"created_at":"2026-11-08T09:58:18.416339+00:00","dir":"out","id":"e_01m6x9gc49yjmzyvvr","other_id":"n_01m6x9gc2szxte6mca","other_kind":"concept","other_layer":"knowledge","other_name":"Convolutional Neural Network","other_name_zh":"卷积神经网络","other_occurred_at":null,"other_slug":"convolutional-neural-network","other_summary":"用局部连接、权重共享和池化处理网格数据（如图像）的神经网络。","rationale":"YOLO 的检测网络是受 GoogLeNet 启发的卷积网络，含 24 个卷积层和 2 个全连接层。","sources":[{"quote":null,"title":"You Only Look Once: Unified, Real-Time Object Detection","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1506.02640"}],"type":"uses","valid_from":null,"valid_to":null}],"sources":[{"field":null,"published_at":"2015-06-08","publisher":"arXiv","quote":null,"title":"You Only Look Once: Unified, Real-Time Object Detection","url":"https://arxiv.org/ab